      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Benton,_Tennessee",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A relocated Fort Marr blockhouse near Benton preserves a tangible piece of early 19th‑century frontier defense.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
